# SmartLogix AI - Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.
Frontend variables must be prefixed with `VITE_` to be exposed to the Vite app; do not place service-role keys, API secrets, or private credentials in `VITE_*` variables.

## Frontend (Vite / browser-safe)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

## Server-side only (Vercel / API runtime, never in frontend)
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=
# SMARTLOGIX_N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET=
# SHOPIFY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# SHOPIFY_API_KEY=
# SHOPIFY_API_SECRET=
# SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=
# GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN=
# GMAIL_SENDER=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=
# CARRIER_TRACKING_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

## Notes
# - Create a dedicated Supabase project for SmartLogix AI.
# - Enable Supabase Auth email/password and provision operator users in Supabase.
# - n8n integration architecture is prepared, but no paid/external services are connected by default.
# - Configure external integrations only in secure server environments and n8n credentials.